// torogao-modapp-dynamics/1 — measured tables for the Modification
// App remake systems, transcribed from the clean-room RE record
// (~/workspace/nsfw-remakes-20261108/games/modification-app-dynamics.md;
// evidence: primo ~/.local/share/pax/modapp-20261108/ — plaintext PCK
// tables Story_StoryFlow.json / Features_MiaStates.json /
// Features_Items_Items.json, and 112 GDScript sources decompiled from
// the shipped bytecode with GDRE Tools v2.7.4, 2026-11-08).
//
// Every value below is a measurement from the 0.12.3 build (Godot
// 4.7.1), not a design choice. Fields whose source semantics are not
// established are called out in the spec's REVIEW register and are
// absent here rather than invented. Node/state/item identifiers are
// structural table keys from the measured data; all shipped text in
// the remake is estate-original placeholder data authored at the
// Owner-gated content pass — none of the original's text is carried.
(
    // The day is exactly four slots (TimeOfDay Morning/Afternoon/
    // Evening/Night = 0..=3). AddTime wraps slot 3 into day+1 slot 0;
    // a completed node sets time 0 of the next day.
    slots_per_day: 4,
    // Minigame difficulty at or above this value is a teleport
    // (express) run. Constants.TeleportDifficulty.
    teleport_difficulty: 800,
    // Quick-travel price: 20 TP per node on the route (PathsMap).
    // NOTE: no deduction for this price exists in the 0.12.3 sources
    // (spec REVIEW #2); the crate enforces affordability only.
    teleport_price_per_node: 20,
    // First-view bonus for a new event (AddPointsNewEvent default).
    new_event_points: 100,
    // The store unlocks once this many "level >= 4 node-enter"
    // events have been seen (TIGHTLY_STORE create condition).
    store_unlock_min_high_events: 2,
    store_unlock_min_level_digit: 4,
    // Retroactive grant at store unlock: seen nodes * this value
    // (TIGHTLY_STORE.UnlockPreviousPoints).
    store_catchup_per_seen_node: 105,
    // Points assigned by the cafe-unlock branch (_Other dialogue).
    cafe_unlock_points: 50,
    // Subject room per time slot (RoomIds Kitchen, LivingRoom,
    // Bathroom, MiaBedroom). MiaStates Default SCHEDULE, cross-
    // verified against GameData's default schedule.
    schedule: [5, 4, 2, 1],
    // Named flags -> the SeenEvents string that satisfies them
    // (Constants.Flags; event names are "<Resource>-<title>").
    flags: {
        "ASS_UNLOCKED": "AssExpansion-1-enter",
        "SHRINK_UNLOCKED": "Shrink-1-enter",
        "STORE": "Default-tightlyStoreUnlock",
        "CAFE": "cafeUnlock",
    },
    // The story graph (StoryFlow). time_gate is the single day-slot
    // at which the node may start (None = ungated); req_flag names a
    // flags entry that must be seen or the node is hidden from the
    // menu; minigame is (class, level); branch_add_time_total is the
    // file-wide count of AddTime calls across all branches of the
    // node's dialogue (one playthrough takes one branch).
